<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .form-label {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 100px;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .form-input {
    border-bottom: 1px solid black;
    display: inline-block;
    width: calc(100% - 100px);
    margin-left: 10px;
  }
  .section-title {
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .checkbox-group label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">HERA</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 14pt;">Virtual</p>
    <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-top: 20px;">2023 Membership and Registration Form</h2>
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Send your completed registration form with a <span data-field="payment_method">{{ payment_method }}</span> made out in U.S. Dollars to:</p>
  <p style="margin-bottom: 40px;">HERA, P.O. Box <span data-field="mailing_box">{{ mailing_box }}</span> Pacifica, CA <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span>.</p>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p>Name</p>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
      <span style="width: 100px;"></span>
      <span class="form-input" style="flex-grow: 1;">{{ full_name }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p>Affiliation</p>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
      <span style="width: 100px;"></span>
      <span class="form-input" style="flex-grow: 1;">{{ employer.name }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p>Email</p>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
      <span style="width: 100px;"></span>
      <span class="form-input" style="flex-grow: 1;">{{ contact_email }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <p>Phone</p>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center;">
      <span style="width: 100px;"></span>
      <span class="form-input" style="flex-grow: 1;">{{ contact_phone }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title">2023 MEMBERSHIP FEES</h2>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">(Check the appropriate category.)</p>

  <div class="checkbox-group" style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <label>
      <input type="checkbox"> <span data-field="membership_options[0].description">{{ membership_options[0].description }}</span>
    </label>
    <label>
      <input type="checkbox"> <span data-field="membership_options[1].description">{{ membership_options[1].description }}</span>
    </label>
    <label>
      <input type="checkbox"> <span data-field="membership_options[2].description">{{ membership_options[2].description }}</span>
    </label>
    <label>
      <input type="checkbox"> <span data-field="membership_options[3].description">{{ membership_options[3].description }}</span>
    </label>
    <label>
      <input type="checkbox"> <span data-field="membership_options[4].description">{{ membership_options[4].description }}</span>
    </label>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">2023 CONFERENCE REGISTRATION</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">(Check the appropriate category.)</p>
  </div>

  <div class="checkbox-group" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <label>
      <input type="checkbox"> <span data-field="conference_options[0].description">{{ conference_options[0].description }}</span>
    </label>
    <label>
      <input type="checkbox"> <span data-field="conference_options[1].description">{{ conference_options[1].description }}</span>
    </label>
    <label>
      <input type="checkbox"> <span data-field="conference_options[2].description">{{ conference_options[2].description }}</span>
    </label>
    <label>
      <input type="checkbox"> <span data-field="conference_options[3].description">{{ conference_options[3].description }}</span>
    </label>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>2023 Convention Participant: Registration must be postmarked by <span data-field="postmark_date">{{ postmark_date }}</span>, and must be in U.S. currency. Your postmark will be the ultimate determinant of your registration rates.</p>
    <p>Schedule change requests disrupt the plans of those already registered. HERA is not able to process changes to the program. Participants who have not paid the convention registration fee and membership dues by <span data-field="payment_deadline">{{ payment_deadline }}</span>, will be deleted from all versions of the convention program. All presenters must be members of HERA.</p>
    <p>Refunds: Requests for refunds must be made in writing and postmarked no later than <span data-field="refund_deadline">{{ refund_deadline }}</span>. Email requests for refunds to <span data-field="refund_email">{{ refund_email }}</span>. A <span data-field="service_fee">{{ service_fee }}</span> service fee is deducted from all refunds. There will be no refunds for any reason after <span data-field="final_refund_date">{{ final_refund_date }}</span>.</p>
    <p>HERA is not responsible for technical difficulties during sessions.</p>
  </div>
</div>